# Sweeney Achieng Otieno | Portfolio

A personal portfolio website for **Sweeney Achieng Otieno**, a full stack developer. The site is about me and my achievements: what I've accomplished, the work I'm proud of, and how to get in touch.

It is built with **HTML and CSS only**. There is no JavaScript, no framework, and nothing to install.

**Live site:** [https://sweeneyachieng-sys.github.io/portfolio](https://sweeneyachieng-sys.github.io/portfolio)


## About

I'm Sweeney Achieng Otieno, a full stack developer. This portfolio is where I talk about my achievements and share the milestones that show my growth as a developer.

